{"parse": {"title": "SU-10", "pageid": 134652, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/SU-09\" title=\"SU-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">SU-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/SU-11\" title=\"SU-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">SU</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B9.90.E5.9C.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"乐土\">乐土</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 乐土</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">To \"Heaven\"</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>命<span class=\"color-value\"></span>运<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>里<span class=\"color-value\"></span>慷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>慨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>预<span class=\"color-value\"></span>售<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>梦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>寐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>求<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3410110</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_29_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_29_zone\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_29_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_at_29_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_29_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"922\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0b/Cg-3_4_at_29_zone.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"656\" data-file-height=\"1008\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烛火盈盈，台上踱步如风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你想获得长生吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_27.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_27\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_27\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-3_4_at_27.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_27.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-3_4_at_27.png/900px-Cg-3_4_at_27.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-3_4_at_27.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_at_27.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑抬头，眼前却是空无一物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">你想获得长生吗？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>世上人不学仙真是蠢。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>嗯？这是哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑从床上坐了起来，打量着四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>嘿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>这里好生气派……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞身下床，惠姑好奇地在房内四处踱步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>好柔软的床，被子也很暖和……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>我做了个好奇怪的梦，但是睡得又特别足！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>吸——呼——神清气爽！入秋以后一直都没什么精神，可今天我却觉得自己可以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>可以插一亩地的秧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>说不定，那个跟我差不多高的大花瓶也举得起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说着，惠姑便走向放置在房间角落的花瓶，跃跃欲试地比画着它的高度和直径。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642317.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-642317.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642317.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642317.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-642317.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642317.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-642317.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642317.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>惠姑，你醒了？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_08\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-3_4_at_08.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-3_4_at_08.png/900px-Cg-3_4_at_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/Cg-3_4_at_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_at_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>您……您是？咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>鹭鸶剪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>刚才我与鹭鸶剪在门外谈些事情，听到房间内有响动，便想应该是你终于醒了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你现在身处梅花教内，想必一定有很多疑问。无妨，我们慢慢来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身着白衣的夫人微笑着点点头，继续向惠姑介绍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我是梅花教的掌门，大家都称我任仙子，你也这么跟着叫便好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-642502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-642502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-642502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>任仙子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>难道您、您就是那个“仙人”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>请仙人授我长生之法！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>呵呵……又是一个初见而不知真貌的小家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>你要找的人就在此处，可并不是我。当年，我也是承了她的恩，才习得这长生之法的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>……诶？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑的目光在任仙子和鹭鸶剪之间游移，然后试探性地落在了鹭鸶剪身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>任仙子不语，也笑着看向鹭鸶剪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>鹭鸶剪——？！你是说鹭鸶剪她才是仙人？！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪搅着碗里的甜汤，里面的白砂糖因为饱和而沉了底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>可以不用这个词称呼我吗？听了只觉得身上有蚂蚁在爬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>这到底是怎么回事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>你还记得昨晚的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>昨晚……在戏台上，我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>是了，昨晚鹭鸶剪在戏台上为你以剑抚顶，做了仪式，之后你就睡得十分之香甜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>你现在感觉如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>倒是觉得神清气爽，也有力气了不少……我已然长生了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>不，你只是跨进了长生的门槛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>鹭鸶剪初步扭转了你体内的气蕴，使其运行更接近天道，符合继续修行的条件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>要想真正获得长生，还需在梅花教内用特定的法子继续修行，这法门我会慢慢教与你们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>这样啊，等、等一下……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑疑惑地掰起了手指头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>也就是说……鹭鸶剪是任仙子的师父……是梅花教的师祖……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>那你明明什么都知道……一路上还跟我装傻充愣……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>好啊，原来我也被你骗了，这下我……我不会再内疚啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我没有故意要瞒你啦……原先我也不知你是来找任仙子的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我本不知庙会的安排，后来才晓得任仙子本来要在戏台上传法，我一时兴起便替了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>怎么样，昨晚我厉害吧？你是不是都没意识到戏台上的人变成我了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>想到高兴之处，鹭鸶剪美滋滋地舀了一口甜汤放进嘴里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>那……那日临别时，我口袋中的护符和纸条，也是你通过这法子放的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯，这法子我很久没使过了，正好这趟出来，不就得着几个机会了嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>别苦着脸呀，惠姑，你知道吗，昨天演出的效果可好了！现在有好多小妖怪都在外面排着队要学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>学也是学长生之法，不是你这乱七八糟的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>……啊不，不成，怎么能对仙人这样说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑还没说完，便被门外一阵急匆匆的脚步声打断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>咦……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那脚步声到了门口，倏地停了下来，紧接着一阵窃窃私语和衣裳摩挲之声传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然，门口露出一只矮胖的小刺猬、一只头上长草的山药精，紧接着是一只灰鼠精、一只鼩鼱精，后面还有一群排成长队、乌泱泱的小精怪们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"643102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"643102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">喧闹的小妖：</div><div>仙人！听说您在此处，我们冒昧来看您……和新来的小师妹了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"643502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-643502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-643502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"643502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-643502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-643502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-643502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-643502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">害羞的小妖：</div><div>师……师祖，晚辈不才，您见面给我们带的那些贵重法器，晚辈没……没有好报答的回礼，若您不嫌弃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>哎哟，这有什么。咱们都是同脉传人，这是我头次来教门看你们，也是应该的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"643102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"643102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">喧闹的小妖：</div><div>仙……啊呸呸，师祖客气了，昨夜您表演完那招后，咱们好多人都说想学呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪摆摆手，脸上的表情却是很受用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这有何难！回头我教你们就是，你们还想学什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>涌入的精怪们和鹭鸶剪正热闹地攀谈着，惠姑看着被围成一圈的鹭鸶剪，摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>咳咳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几声清响，任仙子用咳嗽打断了这场热闹的师门相聚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>好了，别闹你们师祖了，如此嬉笑，成何体统？该修炼的便回去修炼，其他人各自回位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"643502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-643502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-643502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"643502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-643502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-643502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-643502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-643502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">害羞的小妖：</div><div>可……可我听说师祖多年未踏足我们梅花教，昨夜才第一次到来……大家，大家都想多跟师祖说说话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我也很想和大家多聊聊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>任仙子微笑了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>你们师祖将在教门内停留多日，到时有什么问题，尽管问便是了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>只是怕你们现在打扰到新进门的师妹，惠姑，你说是不是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>诶……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>你刚刚得法，身体正是需要适应的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>你们这些做师兄师姐的，带惠姑多走动走动，了解下咱们教门的环境，如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>哦，对！是得多活动活动！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"643102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"643102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">喧闹的小妖：</div><div>师父说得是，咱们确实冒昧了些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"643102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"643102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">喧闹的小妖：</div><div>你叫惠姑是吧？其实咱们也给你带了一点礼……嘿，刚刚只管围着师祖转，差点忘了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这只小妖拿出了早已准备好的数盒药材、几笼糕点放在桌上，份量看着并不轻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>啊……谢谢你们的好意！我……我也觉得身体里有股劲儿，十分想出去跑跑跳跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>前庭那边还挺好玩的，惠姑你可叫它们带你过去看看，等回来再拆礼也不迟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>照，那我们先走一步，不打搅二位大人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑拍了拍裙面，便随着小妖们一同离开了厢房，不久后，庭院内便传来了梅花教弟子的惊呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"643102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"643102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-643102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-643102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">喧闹的小妖：</div><div>师妹！那可是千斤大鼎，举不得啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>呵呵……想当初我刚获得长生之时，也是这般，不知力该往何处使了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪从碗里舀了一大口甜汤，随后便把碗放在了桌子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>你那“五感退化”的毛病，有好些吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯——嗯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>任仙子点点头，等待鹭鸶剪把嘴里的东西咽下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>还是那样子，这次回来，连“清白盏”的味道都尝不出来了……还是聊聊正事吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>近日我夜中起卦望气，险道兽揽诸已醒了五六分，我来的路上也看到了不少异象预兆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>冬天千鸟北徙，枯草变黑……用不了多久，它便会完全苏醒了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>揽诸与其他险道兽有异，它脱离了侲子的管束，在涣州一带兴风作浪，引发地震。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>曾经，我白马派以“金丹术”与其缠斗百年，能做的也仅是将其堵塞的气穴打通，使其再次陷入沉睡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>后有了祖师得大道所赐的两把长生剑，才让普通弟子也有了运转阴阳之气、安抚揽诸之力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>但现在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪停了停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>我知晓你的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>任仙子在空中划了一个法阵，那法阵金光萦绕了一阵后便退却，显出一把通体莹白的剑来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪沉重地望着这把剑，空中的长生剑发出温润莹莹的白光，一如既往。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>如今，长生剑只余一把。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>白马派亦已不存于世。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她紧握着剑柄，双手略有些颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>……不必担心，自从你手中接过长生剑后，我便开始考虑镇压揽诸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>我知揽诸一旦苏醒，定有天崩地裂、乾坤失序、日月同天之象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>若镇压失败，不只是祝县，整个涣州都将分崩离析，百姓将面临灭顶之灾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>于是我便创立梅花教，好广集天下群侠之力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>这几十年间，我已做好了万全的打算，既有长生剑作倚靠，又列了“镇殃大阵”以作后手，万无一失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>哦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>你很惊讶？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪环视厢房，轻轻地叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不，只是感慨那年今日，你还是梅花树下的一名小妖……如今已是一方教派的掌门了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>呵呵……对你来说数旬光阴并无区别，但对我们这些寿命不过几轮圆月的小妖就不是了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>人生苦短。既然你将此事托付于我，我定将全力以赴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>镇压之事不会出纰漏，这是为了梅花教，更是为了天下人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看着任仙子的微笑，鹭鸶剪一怔，随后摇头一笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>看来我是多虑了，你的考量比我周全许多。不过我要提醒，好生护着你的徒儿们，别让白马派灭门一事再度重演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我会在祝县待到镇压结束，危难之时我也会出手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>任仙子郑重地点点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>当初梅树下，你授我长生，赐我长生剑，才有了今天的我与梅花教。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">任仙子：</div><div>在此事上，我与梅花教必将全力以赴，定不负你的赐剑之恩，也不负你师门未竟的遗命。你放心。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "SU-10"}}